From: Raviteja Sunkara <raviteja@codeaurora.org>
Date: Tue, 3 May 2011 12:48:41 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] refactored out ProjectWatchKeyEditor into its own file.

The Editor contains two input text fields for entering Project name and
Filter text, and buttons 'watch', 'browse' and 'cancel'. Upon clicking
'watch' button, it adds or updates ProjectWatchKey with the input strings
from the textfields.

